{"3607810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul•Last Bastion", "steam_appid": 3607810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Roguelike — Experience the true revolution of <strong>Global Strategy Building</strong>! Forge a brand-new battlefield by your own rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.poster.avif?t=1786093554\" width=1080 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.webm?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.mp4?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six distinct races, each with unique prowess.</strong>Dozens of exclusive units are now available. Every race boasts its own combat style and core abilities, and more factions will join your ranks in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Swarm: Unending tides of bugs sweep across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Archers: Volleys of arrows rain down, securing victory from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Anomalies: Impenetrable armor that reflects incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans: Lightning strikes across the battlefield to claim victory with a single blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psionic Masters: Devastating mental assaults that strike multiple targets at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenixes of the Undead: Freeze all things and snuff out every spark of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Era of Buildcraft — Command an Entire Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas