9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/52e1843c8462b2345f16b62c00040a2e.mp4?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Battle Modes, Jump into the fray anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand alone against alien invaders and survive against all odds; engage in a head-on clash of strategy and luck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Roguelike — Experience the true revolution of <strong>Global Strategy Building</strong>! Forge a brand-new battlefield by your own rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.poster.avif?t=1786093554\" width=1080 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.webm?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/61c0c5fb6f1d141fe1db7ae4102312a3.mp4?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six distinct races, each with unique prowess.</strong>Dozens of exclusive units are now available. Every race boasts its own combat style and core abilities, and more factions will join your ranks in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Swarm: Unending tides of bugs sweep across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Archers: Volleys of arrows rain down, securing victory from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Anomalies: Impenetrable armor that reflects incoming damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans: Lightning strikes across the battlefield to claim victory with a single blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psionic Masters: Devastating mental assaults that strike multiple targets at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenixes of the Undead: Freeze all things and snuff out every spark of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Era of Buildcraft — Command an Entire Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/96b944e5879d62898a9048ab07d5b4f7.poster.avif?t=1786093554\" width=1080 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/96b944e5879d62898a9048ab07d5b4f7.webm?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/96b944e5879d62898a9048ab07d5b4f7.mp4?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/e3bc74bd25ae6d26e69a3f1253d003e0.poster.avif?t=1786093554\" width=1080 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/e3bc74bd25ae6d26e69a3f1253d003e0.webm?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras/e3bc74bd25ae6d26e69a3f1253d003e0.mp4?t=1786093554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have broken the boundaries of single-character progression and introduced an all-new <strong>Global Roguelike Build System</strong>. Every card pick empowers all units of your race. Combined with unique traits of different units, you can create countless tactical builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607810/extras